Package: gpod-utils
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Command line tools using 'libgpod' to access 'iPod' data.
 With the CI build this links a static ffmpeg into each tool that needs it.

Package: gpod-utils-shared
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Provides: gpod-utils (= ${binary:Version})
Conflicts: gpod-utils
Replaces: gpod-utils
Description: Command line tools using 'libgpod' to access 'iPod' data (shared ffmpeg).
 Same tools as gpod-utils, linked against one private copy of ffmpeg's shared
 libraries (/usr/lib/<triplet>/gpod-utils/libav*-gpod.so) instead of a static
 ffmpeg in every tool - a much smaller install.
